              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h2><b><span class=\"futura-bold\">Triathlon Hinge</span></b></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">The Triathlon Hinge offers easy conversion to any Stryker revision procedure with the Triathlon Revision Baseplate. Triathlon Hinge is built on the clinical success of the Triathlon TS and Modular Rotating Hinge (MRH™).<sup>4,5</sup></span></span></span></p>\n",
