          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 26 2025 17:39:14 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><b><span class=\"futura-bold\">GMRS</span></b></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">The GMRS was developed for reconstruction of large segmental defects for tumors, failed previous arthroplasty or trauma. This system is designed to:</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Reconstruct large segmental defects of the knee</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Reconstruct osteoarticular defects of varying sizes</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Allow for variation and intraoperative changes of the surgical plan</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Dec 29 2025 21:46:28 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "textIsRich": "true",
