          "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 26 2017 10:56:24 GMT-0400",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h4><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Send us a message to learn more about&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Triathlon Revision.</span></span></span></span></h4>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This contact form is intended for healthcare professionals. If you’re looking to contact us about patient materials, <span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><a href=\"https://patients.stryker.com/\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">please go here</span></a></span>.</span></p>\n",
