    "disclaimer-type": "text",
    "disclaimer": "<p>References</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>D0000236435, Triathlon Hinge Design Verification Memo.</li>\r\n<li>Masini, M et al. The Joint Reduction Method of Revision Total Knee Arthroplasty. Orthopedics. 2004; 27-8: 813-816.</li>\r\n<li>Mahoney, O et al. Modular femoral Offset Stems Facilitate Joint Line Restoration in Revision Knee Arthroplasty Clin. Orthop. 446, 2006: pp.93-98.</li>\r\n<li>Wignadasan W, Chang JS, Kayani B, Kontoghiorghe C, Haddad FS. Long-term results of revision total knee arthroplasty using a rotating hinge implant. Knee. 2021Jan;28:72-80. doi: 10.1016/j.knee.2020.11.009. Epub 2020 Dec 10. PMID: 33310668.2.</li>\r\n<li>Hamilton DF, Simpson PM, Patton JT, Howie CR, Burnett R. Aseptic Revision Knee Arthroplasty With Total Stabilizer Prostheses Achieves Similar Functional Outcomes to Primary Total Knee Arthroplasty at 2 Years: A Longitudinal Cohort Study. J Arthroplasty. 2017 Apr;32(4):1234-1240.e1</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n",
